  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Top Reasons to Book!<br><br>• Private courtyard with dipping pool (21ft x 10ft) – heat optional add'l $50/night<br><br>• Just Steps to Inlet Beach access<br><br>* Beach Service Included!<br><br>• 4 bikes included! <br><br>• Porches and balcony with outdoor seating <br><br>• Heated floors in living room and kitchen!<br><br>• Kitchenette in second living area<br><br>• Gated community with pool and grill<br><br>• Walk or bike to Rosemary Beach<br><br>• Professionally managed with 24/7 service<br><br>*Guests must be 25+ to rent. No exceptions.*<br><br><br>Casa del Mar is a stunning Spanish-style home featuring a newly designed private courtyard with a pool, grill, and outdoor dining area. Tucked within the gated Pinecrest community, this 5BR/5.5BA retreat offers over 2,800 sq. ft. of elegant living space. Inside, enjoy a spacious open floor plan with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and shiplap accents. The first-floor king suite includes a private ensuite bath, while the second floor offers three queen bedrooms (each with ensuite baths) and a twin bunk room, sleeping up to 10 guests. Driveway parking only – fits up to 3 cars. This inviting home blends luxury, location, and leisure in one perfect package. Come relax, explore, and make lasting memories at Casa del Mar — your serene getaway on the Emerald Coast. <br><br>Bed Setup:<br><br>1st Floor<br>Master Bedroom: King Bed<br><br>2nd Floor<br>Master Bedroom #2: Queen Bed<br><br>Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed<br><br>Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed<br><br>Bunk Room: Twin Bunks<br><br>Located near Rosemary Beach and 30Avenue, guests can easily walk or bike to restaurants, shops, and cafes. The beach is a short stroll away, and the community pool and grill area offer extra space to relax.<br><br>Snorkelers will love exploring the Grouper Reef, located just 970 feet offshore from Inlet Beach access — a vibrant spot for sea life and underwater adventure.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
